stom menu-item-12389"><a href="/en/methodology/">Methodology</a></li><li id="menu-item-15350" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-15350"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/mission/">Mission</a></li><li id="menu-item-12390" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-12390"><a href="/en/transparency/">Transparency</a></li><li id="menu-item-12392" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-12392"><a href="/presse/">Press</a></li><li id="menu-item-12393" class="menu-bottom menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-12393"><a href="/en/frequently-asked-questions/">FAQs</a></li><li id="menu-item-12394" class="menu-bottom menu-newsletter menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-12394"><a href="/#newsletter">Newsletter</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="mega-menu-item mega-menu-item-type-widget widget_media_image mega-menu-column-standard mega-menu-columns-1-of-3 mega-menu-item-media_image-3" style="--columns:3; --span:1" id="mega-menu-item-media_image-3"><img width="405" height="344" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/team_anne.png" class="image wp-image-17781  attachment-full size-full" alt="" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" decoding="async" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/team_anne.png 405w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/team_anne-300x255.png 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/team_anne-14x12.png 14w" sizes="(max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px" /></li></ul></li><li class="mega-btn-spenden mega-menu-item mega-menu-item-type-custom mega-menu-item-object-custom mega-align-bottom-left mega-menu-flyout mega-menu-item-12379 btn-spenden" id="mega-menu-item-12379"><a class="mega-menu-link" href="/en/spenden/">Donate now</a></li><li class="mega-menu-extra mega-menu-item mega-menu-item-type-custom mega-menu-item-object-custom mega-align-bottom-left mega-menu-flyout mega-menu-item-12380 menu-extra" id="mega-menu-item-12380"><a class="mega-menu-link" href="/en/frequently-asked-questions/">FAQs</a></li><li class="mega-menu-extra mega-menu-newsletter mega-menu-item mega-menu-item-type-custom mega-menu-item-object-custom mega-align-bottom-left mega-menu-flyout mega-menu-item-12381 menu-extra menu-newsletter" id="mega-menu-item-12381"><a class="mega-menu-link" href="/#newsletter">Newsletter</a></li></ul></div></header><main class="wp-block-group" id="page-top"><div class="entry-content wp-block-post-content"><div class="wp-block-group alignfull funds-page"><div id="main-slider" class="wp-block-group main-slider-section hero-section"><div class="wp-block-columns slider-section-inner"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center slider-col-left"><h1 class="wp-block-heading hero-heading has-foreground-color has-text-color">Safeguarding the Future</h1><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange btn-orange-outline btn-direkt"><div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="#spendenfonds" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Giving Fund: Safeguarding the Future</a></div><div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="#spendenfonds-ki" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Giving Fund: Ensuring Safe AI.</a></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-column slider-col-right"><div class="wp-block-cb-carousel cb-single-slide" data-slick="{&quot;slidesToShow&quot;:1,&quot;slidesToScroll&quot;:1,&quot;speed&quot;:900,&quot;arrows&quot;:false,&quot;dots&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;autoplaySpeed&quot;:3000,&quot;infinite&quot;:true,&quot;responsive&quot;:[{&quot;breakpoint&quot;:769,&quot;settings&quot;:{&quot;slidesToShow&quot;:1,&quot;slidesToScroll&quot;:1}}]}"><div class="wp-block-cb-slide"><figure class="wp-block-image alignright size-full"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/effektiv-spenden_zukunft_possessed-photography-jIBMSMs4_kA-unsplash.png" alt="" class="wp-image-14311 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="750" height="732" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/effektiv-spenden_zukunft_possessed-photography-jIBMSMs4_kA-unsplash.png" alt="" class="wp-image-14311 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/effektiv-spenden_zukunft_possessed-photography-jIBMSMs4_kA-unsplash.png 750w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/effektiv-spenden_zukunft_possessed-photography-jIBMSMs4_kA-unsplash-300x293.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" /></noscript></figure></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group section"><h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Uncertain times with high risks</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We live in a time of great uncertainty. Humanity faces ever-increasing risks that threaten our future, including wars between major powers and even nuclear wars, natural and man-made pandemics, threats from advanced artificial intelligence (AI) and risks from new military technologies. These global catastrophic risks have the potential to kill billions of people and jeopardize the future of humanity.</p></div><div class="wp-block-group section"><h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>For the safety of humankind</strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Together, we can all - scientists, political decision-makers, the public, etc. - address and mitigate these risks. There are also some historical examples of this. During the Cold War, world leaders worked together to reduce stockpiles of weapons of mass destruction. At the turn of the millennium, scientists undertook an unprecedented effort to reduce the threat of large asteroid and comet impacts through better asteroid calculations and tracking. A growing global movement is now seeking to increase readiness for further measures to make future pandemics less likely in the wake of COVID-19.</p></div><div id="spendenfonds" class="wp-block-group recommended-orgs section" style="margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80)"><h2 id="spendenfonds-zukunft-bewahren" class="wp-block-heading">Giving Fund: Safeguarding the Future</h2><div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-columns laptop-width"><div class="wp-block-column project-left" style="padding-right:0"><figure class="wp-block-image alignleft size-full"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/risks.png" alt="" class="wp-image-20689 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="346" height="345" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/risks.png" alt="" class="wp-image-20689 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/risks.png 346w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/risks-300x300.png 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/risks-150x150.png 150w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/risks-12x12.png 12w" sizes="(max-width: 346px) 100vw, 346px" /></noscript></figure><figure class="wp-block-image alignleft size-full org-logo"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren@4x.png" alt="" class="wp-image-23923 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren@4x.png" alt="" class="wp-image-23923 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren@4x.png 400w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren@4x-300x300.png 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren@4x-150x150.png 150w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren@4x-12x12.png 12w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /></noscript></figure></div><div class="wp-block-column project-right"><div class="wp-block-group"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Giving Fund: Safeguarding the Future aims to support particularly promising measures to reduce the greatest known risks to humanity. The fund is intended to address threats to the long-term future of humanity as well as promote measures that contribute to the protection of all people living today.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We decide on the allocation of funds from our donation fund every six months together with the charitable philanthropy consultancy <a href="https://www.longview.org/"><em>Longview Philanthropy</em></a> and orient ourselves to their <a href="https://www.longview.org/fund/emerging-challenges-fund/"><em>Emerging Challenges Fund</em></a>. This focuses on high-impact and neglected initiatives to reduce the likelihood of global disasters and mitigate their impact. These include conflicts between major powers, nuclear wars, pandemics, man-made biological weapons, catastrophic laboratory accidents and emerging risks from new military and civilian technologies, including artificial intelligence (AI). In the past, as part of this donation fund, we have also worked with the <a href="https://founderspledge.com/stories/introducing-the-global-catastrophic-risks-gcr-fund">Global Catastrophic Risks Fund</a> of the institute <a href="https://www.founderspledge.com/"><em>Founders Pledge.</em></a> as part of this Giving Fund.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Giving Fund addresses a complex challenge in an ever-changing threat landscape. If you believe that reducing existential risks is particularly important for the long-term survival and growth of as many generations of people as possible, the Fund offers a highly effective approach. Or perhaps you are interested in the Fund for the simple reason that you want to help prevent the death and suffering of billions of people alive today.</p><div class="wp-block-group inline-buttons" style="padding-left:0"><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange"><div class="wp-block-button btn-orange is-style-outline is-style-outline--3"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="/en/spenden/?grantee=spenden-fonds-zukunft-bewahren" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Donate to the fund</a></div></div><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange btn-orange-outline"><div class="wp-block-button btn-orange is-style-outline is-style-outline--4"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/donor-advisory/" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Book an advisory session</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="spendenfonds-ki" class="wp-block-group recommended-orgs section" style="margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--80)"><h2 id="spendenfonds-ki" class="wp-block-heading">Giving Fund: Ensuring Safe AI.</h2><div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-columns laptop-width"><div class="wp-block-column project-left" style="padding-right:0"><figure class="wp-block-image alignleft size-full"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Artificial-Intelligence-Fonds-Teaser.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-14382 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="346" height="346" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Artificial-Intelligence-Fonds-Teaser.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-14382 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Artificial-Intelligence-Fonds-Teaser.jpg 346w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Artificial-Intelligence-Fonds-Teaser-300x300.jpg 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Artificial-Intelligence-Fonds-Teaser-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 346px) 100vw, 346px" /></noscript></figure><figure class="wp-block-image alignleft size-full org-logo"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten@4x.png" alt="" class="wp-image-23924 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten@4x.png" alt="" class="wp-image-23924 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten@4x.png 400w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten@4x-300x300.png 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten@4x-150x150.png 150w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten@4x-12x12.png 12w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /></noscript></figure></div><div class="wp-block-column project-right"><div class="wp-block-group"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Giving Fund: Ensuring safe AI is aimed at donors who wish to focus fully on the risks posed by advanced artificial intelligence (AI) in the field "Safeguarding the Future".</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">AI holds great potential, but can also pose a threat to humanity. The capabilities of advanced AI have grown rapidly in recent years. An AI that has overtaken humans intellectually could be able to exert considerable influence on its environment and slip out of human control.<a style="text-decoration:none" class="footnoteLink" id="fn1" href="#1"><sup>[1]</sup></a> There is also a risk that such influential technology could fall into the wrong hands. With the help of AI, terrorists could try to develop pandemic viruses<a style="text-decoration:none" class="footnoteLink" id="fn2" href="#2"><sup>[2]</sup></a> or foreign adversaries carry out cyber attacks on an unprecedented scale<a style="text-decoration:none" class="footnoteLink" id="fn3" href="#3"><sup>[3]</sup></a>. As hundreds of researchers, including Nobel Prize winners Geoffrey Hinton and Demis Hassabis, <a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/artificial-intelligence-an-existential-threat-to-humanity/">stated in May 2023</a>: "Mitigating the risk of extinction from AI should be a global priority alongside other societal-scale risks such as pandemics and nuclear war."</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Our Giving Fund, like the more general fund "Safeguarding the Future", follows the recommendations of our partner Longview Philanthropy. In the past, we have supported organizations that contribute to safe AI through technical solutions as well as those that focus primarily on regulatory approaches. <a href="/blog/fonds-zukunft-bewahren-h1-2023/#METR">METR</a> for example, builds tools that test large language models for dangerous behavior. <a href="/en/blog/spendenfonds-zukunft-bewahren-in-h1-2024/">CeSIA</a> tries to sensitize French politics, business and science to the risks of AI.</p><div class="wp-block-group inline-buttons" style="padding-left:0"><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange"><div class="wp-block-button btn-orange is-style-outline is-style-outline--5"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/spenden-erweiterte-auswahl/?grantee=spenden-fonds-ki-sicher-gestalten" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Donate to the fund</a></div></div><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange btn-orange-outline"><div class="wp-block-button btn-orange is-style-outline is-style-outline--6"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/ki-kontrollieren/" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><h2 id="bisher-gefoerdert" class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Whom have we supported so far?</strong></h2><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-toggle  root-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-container eb-accordion-2an3tfr" data-accordion-type="accordion" data-tab-icon="fas fa-plus" data-expanded-icon="fas fa-minus" data-transition-duration="500"><div class="eb-accordion-inner"><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-jijms5l eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from H2/2025</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The funds from the „Shaping AI Safely“ donation fund went to the <strong>Safe AI Forum</strong>. The donations were forwarded to the organizations in May 2026.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Click here for the <a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/746000-fuer-nukleare-sicherheit-und-sichere-ki/">detailed fund update</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-jijms5l eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from H1/2025</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The funds from the „Shaping AI Safely“ donation fund went to <strong>SaferAI</strong>. The donations were forwarded to the organizations in August 2025.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Click here for the <a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/270-000-an-saferai-und-das-rand-meselsons-center/">detailed fund update</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-b8v5a eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from H2/2024</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The funds from the „Shaping AI Safely“ donation fund went to <strong>The Future Society</strong>. The donations were forwarded to the organizations in March 2025.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Click here for the <a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/our-giving-fund-safeguarding-the-future-and-ensuring-safe-ai-in-h2-2024/">detailed fund update</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-6cqm9 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from H1/2024</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong><a href="https://www.securite-ia.fr/en">CeSIA</a></strong> — <a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/spendenfonds-zukunft-bewahren-in-h1-2024/">Educating the French public about how artificial intelligence can be developed safely and for the benefit of society</a> (approx. € 195,000)</li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Click here for the <a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/spendenfonds-zukunft-bewahren-in-h1-2024/">detailed fund update</a>.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0">The donations were forwarded to the organization in September 2024.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-u8wci eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from H2/2023</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><a href="https://blueprintbiosecurity.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Blueprint Biosecurity</strong></a> — <a href="/blog/spendenfonds-zukunft-bewahren-h2-2023/#blueprint-biosecurity">Work plans - "blueprints" - for the prevention, mitigation and control of future pandemics</a> (approx. 160,000 €)</li><li><a href="https://www.pourdemain.ngo/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Pour Demain</strong></a> — <a href="/blog/spendenfonds-zukunft-bewahren-h2-2023/#pour-demain">Support for the biosecurity program</a> (CHF 100,000)</li><li><strong><a href="https://www.rand.org/">RAND</a></strong> - Support for the <a href="https://www.rand.org/global-and-emerging-risks/centers/technology-and-security-policy.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Technology and Security Policy Center (TASP)</a> (approx. 160,000 €)</li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">The donations were forwarded to the organizations in February, March and May 2024.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-u12n5 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from H1/2023</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><a href="https://www.globalshieldpolicy.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>Global Shield</strong></a> — <a href="/blog/fonds-zukunft-bewahren-h1-2023/#globalshield">Political measures to reduce global disaster risks</a> ($50.000)</li><li><a href="https://metr.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>METR</strong></a><strong> (formerly ARC Evals)</strong> — <a href="/blog/fonds-zukunft-bewahren-h1-2023/#METR">Evaluation of state-of-the-art AI systems to identify and minimize risks</a> (128.000 €)</li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Grants were made in August 2023.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-j752ov2 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Allocation of funds from Q4/2022</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-2an3tfr"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Carnegie Endowment for International Peace (</strong><a href="https://carnegieendowment.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>CEIP</strong></a><strong>)</strong> — <a href="/blog/fonds-zukunft-bewahren-q4-2022/#ceip">The global risks arising from the war in Ukraine</a> (115.000 €)</li><li><strong>Center for a New American Security (</strong><a href="https://www.cnas.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"><strong>CNAS</strong></a><strong>) </strong>— <a href="/blog/fonds-zukunft-bewahren-q4-2022/#cnas">Workshop on the risks of autonomous weapons systems</a> ($100.000)</li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Grants were made in February 2023.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="height:30px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-group donation-advisor-section desktop"><div class="wp-block-columns donation-advisor" id="donation-advisor-section-desktop"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center col-left"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-background-color has-text-color">Your personal advice</h2><p class="has-text-align-left has-background-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph">Those who donate want to make a difference. We are happy to help you achieve the greatest possible impact in line with your ideas and values. Simply make an appointment for your personal consultation.</p><div class="wp-block-buttons has-text-align-center btn-black"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-foreground-background-color has-background wp-element-button" href="/en/donor-advisory/" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Book a free meeting</a></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-column caption-container"><p class="donation-advisor-details has-background-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph">Anne Schulze,<br>Founder &amp; Managing Director</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group donation-advisor-section mobile"><div class="wp-block-columns donation-advisor" id="donation-advisor-section-mobile"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center col-left"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-background-color has-text-color">Your personal advice</h2><p class="has-text-align-left has-background-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph">Everyone who donates wants to make a difference. We want to help you make the biggest impact possible, in line with your ideas and values. Simply make an appointment for your personal advisory session (in English or German).</p><div class="wp-block-buttons has-text-align-center btn-black"><div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-foreground-background-color has-background wp-element-button" href="/en/donor-advisory/" style="border-radius:100px;padding-top:0;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:0;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);font-style:normal;font-weight:600">Book a free meeting</a></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-column caption-container"><p class="donation-advisor-details has-background-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph">Anne Schulze,<br>Founder &amp; Managing Director</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group alignfull blog-section section"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left section-title" style="margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;text-transform:capitalize">Blog articles</h2><div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-columns blog-section-inner"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top article-block" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/future_society_preview-1.png" alt="" class="wp-image-21838 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="407" height="259" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/future_society_preview-1.png" alt="" class="wp-image-21838 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/future_society_preview-1.png 407w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/future_society_preview-1-300x191.png 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/future_society_preview-1-18x12.png 18w" sizes="(max-width: 407px) 100vw, 407px" /></noscript></figure><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/our-giving-fund-safeguarding-the-future-and-ensuring-safe-ai-in-h2-2024/">Around €600,000 for safe AI and biotechnology</a></h3><p class="article-excerpt wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/safeguarding-the-future-2023/">In the second half of 2024, we had some news in the area of "Safeguarding the future".</a></p><div class="wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-not-stacked-on-mobile author-info"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center" style="flex-basis:60px"><figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full has-custom-border"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/cropped-sebastian_becker_profile.png" alt="" class="wp-image-21622 lazyload" style="border-radius:100px"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="230" height="230" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/cropped-sebastian_becker_profile.png" alt="" class="wp-image-21622 lazyload" style="border-radius:100px" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/cropped-sebastian_becker_profile.png 230w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/cropped-sebastian_becker_profile-150x150.png 150w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/cropped-sebastian_becker_profile-12x12.png 12w" sizes="(max-width: 230px) 100vw, 230px" /></noscript></figure></div><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center"><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Sebastian Becker</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top article-block" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/blog/leitplanken-fuer-militaerische-ki-risiken/"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Drohne_image-from-rawpixel-id-3286694-jpeg-1-407x262-1.png" alt="Image of a drone in flight" class="wp-image-16053 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="407" height="262" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Drohne_image-from-rawpixel-id-3286694-jpeg-1-407x262-1.png" alt="Image of a drone in flight" class="wp-image-16053 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Drohne_image-from-rawpixel-id-3286694-jpeg-1-407x262-1.png 407w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Drohne_image-from-rawpixel-id-3286694-jpeg-1-407x262-1-300x193.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 407px) 100vw, 407px" /></noscript></a></figure><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/blog/leitplanken-fuer-militaerische-ki-risiken/">Guardrails for military AI risks</a></h3><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Confidence-building measures for unmanned and AI-supported military systems - Christian Ruhl from Founders Pledge shares his impressions from a workshop.</p><div class="wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-not-stacked-on-mobile author-info"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center" style="flex-basis:60px"><figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Christian-Ruhl-Effektiv-Spenden-Founders-Pledge.png" alt="Christian Ruhl" class="wp-image-16043 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="500" height="500" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Christian-Ruhl-Effektiv-Spenden-Founders-Pledge.png" alt="Christian Ruhl" class="wp-image-16043 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Christian-Ruhl-Effektiv-Spenden-Founders-Pledge.png 500w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Christian-Ruhl-Effektiv-Spenden-Founders-Pledge-300x300.png 300w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Christian-Ruhl-Effektiv-Spenden-Founders-Pledge-150x150.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></noscript></figure></div><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center"><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Christian Ruhl</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top article-block" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)"><figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/artificial-intelligence-an-existential-threat-to-humanity/"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/kuenstliche-intelligenzexistenzielle-risiken-spenden-mobile.jpg" alt="Artificial intelligence: an existential risk for humanity" class="wp-image-11481 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="406" height="261" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/kuenstliche-intelligenzexistenzielle-risiken-spenden-mobile.jpg" alt="Artificial intelligence: an existential risk for humanity" class="wp-image-11481 lazyload" srcset="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/kuenstliche-intelligenzexistenzielle-risiken-spenden-mobile.jpg 406w, https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/kuenstliche-intelligenzexistenzielle-risiken-spenden-mobile-300x193.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px" /></noscript></a></figure><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:700"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/artificial-intelligence-an-existential-threat-to-humanity/"></a><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/artificial-intelligence-an-existential-threat-to-humanity/">Artificial Intelligence: An existential threat to humanity?</a></h3><p class="article-excerpt wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/artificial-intelligence-an-existential-threat-to-humanity/"></a><a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/artificial-intelligence-an-existential-threat-to-humanity/">Advanced AI poses an existential risk. What solutions are there and what can I do?</a></p><div class="wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-not-stacked-on-mobile author-info"><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center" style="flex-basis:60px"><figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><img decoding="async" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/effektivspenden-sebastian.png" alt="" class="wp-image-12051 lazyload"/><noscript><img decoding="async" width="54" height="54" src="https://effektiv-spenden.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/effektivspenden-sebastian.png" alt="" class="wp-image-12051 lazyload"/></noscript></figure></div><div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center"><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Sebastian Schwiecker</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group" style="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px"><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange btn-orange-outline has-text-align-center"><div class="wp-block-button btn-orange is-style-outline is-style-outline--7"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="/spenden-tipps/" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">View donation tips</a></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group section faq-section"><h2 class="wp-block-heading">FAQs</h2><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-toggle  root-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-container eb-accordion-tanavdq" data-accordion-type="accordion" data-tab-icon="fas fa-plus" data-expanded-icon="fas fa-minus" data-transition-duration="500"><div class="eb-accordion-inner"><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-vtjpudd eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">How much should I donate?</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">How much you want to donate is of course ultimately your own personal decision, but perhaps you will find some inspiration in the articles "<a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/spenden-tipps/wie-viel-soll-ich-spenden/">How much should I donate?</a>" and "<a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/blog/why-and-how-i-donate-guest-article-christoph-hartmann/">Why and how I donate</a>".</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-scurds6 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Can I deduct my donation from my taxes?</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="fn10">Yes, you can make your donation in&nbsp;<strong>Germany</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Switzerland</strong>&nbsp;tax deductible, even if the recommended organizations are based abroad. We will automatically send you a donation receipt for all your donations by e-mail at the end of February of the following year. You don't have to do anything else.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-ma9ju39 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">I don't want to donate online, can I also transfer the money?</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="fn11">You are also welcome to make a traditional bank transfer. Please use&nbsp;<a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/spenden/">our donation form</a>&nbsp;under "Payment method", select the "Bank transfer" tab, enter your details, which we need for the donation receipt, and register your donation. You will then receive an e-mail with our donation account and a reference that will enable us to allocate your donation correctly as soon as you have transferred the donation.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-7snhih0 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">What are the fees? Will you forward 100% of my donation?</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We process donations free of charge, i.e. we do not keep any of your donation for ourselves. However, credit card or PayPal fees are charged by the payment providers we work with. These depend on the selected payment method and are calculated as follows for Germany:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><strong>Bank transfer</strong>: Free of charge within the SEPA payment area</li><li><strong>SEPA-direct debit</strong>: 0,35 €</li><li><strong>Credit card</strong>: 1.2% + 0.25 € (for European cards)</li><li><strong>PayPal</strong>: 1,5% + 0,35 €</li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph translation-block">Therefore  <strong>we recommend the "SEPA-direct debit payment"</strong> for donations of up to €10,000. For security reasons, the only option currently available for amounts of €10,000 or more is  <strong>"Bank transfer"</strong></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">Comparable fees would also be incurred for a direct donation to the respective organizations. We have already negotiated with all payment providers and obtained particularly favorable conditions for non-profit organizations.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">We also finance ourselves through donations, but completely independently.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph translation-block">You can find out more  <a href="/en/transparency/" target="_self">here</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-zr7l7y5 eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">How can I change or cancel my permanent donation?</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="fn11">If you want to increase or decrease the amount of your donation, simply contact us by e-mail at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:info@effektiv-spenden.org">info@effektiv-spenden.org</a>&nbsp;. We are also happy to change the organizations/ projects/funds to which you donate if you wish. Unfortunately, we cannot change payment methods of already existing donations. To do this, you will need to cancel your donation and then set it up again.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">You can cancel your permanent donation at any time and without giving reasons. Simply send us an informal e-mail to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:info@effektiv-spenden.org">info@effektiv-spenden.org</a>&nbsp;or call us at&nbsp;<a href="tel:+493026035519">+49 (0)30 / 260 355 19</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-hya716z eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><span class="fas fa-plus eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">How do you cover your costs?</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-tanavdq"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="fn11"><em>Effektiv Spenden</em>&nbsp;is made possible by private sponsors. This support enables us to cover all administrative costs. This allows us to pass on your donation in full to our top organizations. Of course, we are also happy about your donation to us as a platform. You can find out more about our funding&nbsp;<a href="https://effektiv-spenden.org/en/transparency/">here</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-buttons btn-orange btn-orange-outline has-text-align-center" style="margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)"><div class="wp-block-button btn-orange is-style-outline is-style-outline--8"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-medium-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button" href="/en/frequently-asked-questions/" style="border-radius:100px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600">View all</a></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-group accordion-references laptop-width has-background" style="background-color:#f1f1f1"><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-toggle  root-eb-accordion-pt1i49s"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-accordion-pt1i49s"><div class="eb-accordion-container eb-accordion-pt1i49s" data-accordion-type="accordion" data-tab-icon="fas fa-chevron-right" data-expanded-icon="fas fa-chevron-down" data-transition-duration="500"><div class="eb-accordion-inner"><div class="wp-block-accordion-toggle-accordion-item eb-accordion-item-3uiz4kq eb-accordion-wrapper" data-clickable="false"><div class="eb-accordion-title-wrapper eb-accordion-title-wrapper-eb-accordion-pt1i49s" tabindex="0"><span class="eb-accordion-icon-wrapper eb-accordion-icon-wrapper-eb-accordion-pt1i49s"><span class="fas fa-chevron-right eb-accordion-icon"></span></span><div class="eb-accordion-title-content-wrap title-content-eb-accordion-pt1i49s"><h3 class="eb-accordion-title">Sources</h3></div></div><div class="eb-accordion-content-wrapper eb-accordion-content-wrapper-eb-accordion-pt1i49s"><div class="eb-accordion-content"><p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="1"><a class="footnote" style="text-decoration:none" href="#fn1">[1] ↑</a>&nbsp;Yoshua Bengio et al. <a href="https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.adn0117" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Managing extreme AI risks amid rapid progress</a>. Science, Vol. 384, Issue 6684. May 2024.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph translation-block" id="2"><a class="footnote" style="text-decoration:none" href="#fn2" target="_self">[2] ↑</a> Emily H. Soice et al, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.03809" target="_self">Can large language models democratize access to dual-use biotechnology?</a>. June 2023.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" id="3"><a href="#fn3">[3] ↑</a>&nbsp;OpenAI itself has reported that its models have been used for cyberattacks by actors associated with China, Russia, Iran and North Korea. Although the potential threat is currently still manageable, this could change with future models. OpenAI, <a href="https://openai.com/index/disrupting-malicious-uses-of-ai-by-state-affiliated-threat-actors/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Disrupting malicious uses of AI by state-affiliated threat actors</a>. February 14, 2024.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></main><footer class="wp-block-template-part"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left social-icons-heading"><strong>Also follow us here</strong></h3><ul class="wp-block-social-links social_icons"><li class="wp-social-link wp-social-link-youtube wp-block-social-link"><a rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxBUAOohas5xnuSFCdLjnSA" class="wp-block-social-link-anchor"><svg width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21.8,8.001c0,0-0.195-1.378-0.795-1.985c-0.76-0.797-1.613-0.801-2.004-0.847c-2.799-0.202-6.997-0.202-6.